{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2023-06-14 07:05:00', 'title': 'NEW ORACLE CLOUD SERVICES HELP BANKS MANAGE RISK', 'text': 'SAAS OFFERINGS GIVE BANKS THE FLEXIBILITY AND SCALABILITY TO MODERNIZE RISK MANAGEMENT TO QUICKLY ADAPT TO GLOBAL MARKET VOLATILITY AUSTIN, TEXAS , JUNE 14, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE RECENT FAILURE OF SEVERAL PROMINENT BANKS, HIGHLIGHTED THE NEED FOR FINANCIAL SERVICES INSTITUTIONS TO BETTER ANTICIPATE AND MANAGE RISK. TO ADDRESS THESE CHALLENGES, ORACLE TODAY LAUNCHED NEW CLOUD-NATIVE SERVICES THAT CAN HELP BANKS STRENGTHEN THEIR FINANCE AND RISK MANAGEMENT PROCESSES TO\xa0REFLECT THEIR TARGET RISK APPETITE AND LIMIT EXPOSURE.'}